# Sunx rules

- Product: chat → questionnaire → pay → provision → hosted agent. No customer code.
- Capability matrix is closed; soft-reject anything outside templates.
- Wallet + Stripe webhook before provision. Never trust client-side “paid” flags.
- Connector writes require consent_records + tool policy mode.
- Secrets only on server/worker; encrypt connector tokens.
- Keep AgentSpec Zod-validated; runtime must load Spec, not ad-hoc prompts alone.
- Prefer Inngest/Trigger jobs for provision and indexing.
- After meaningful progress, update docs/sunx/BUILD_STATUS.md.
